    <string name="about_what">An AI-native multi-agent workbench. Yew Harness organizes agent sessions the Session Engineering way: you deal only with the main conversation, and everything that needs your approval or decision comes to the approval center. The sessions run in Yew Harness on your computer.</string>
    <string name="about_phone">Yew Harness on Android connects to your computer through a relay, encrypted end to end. Away from your desk, you handle what needs you here: allow operations, answer the sessions\' questions and decide on cards, and you can follow and reply to sessions.</string>
